# .hky source trees are BYTE-SENSITIVE and must round-trip through hky-pack unchanged:
#   - the frozen vanilla master's animationdata / setdata / roster .txt are CRLF-terminated
#     (the animdata format is CRLF; the root .gitattributes would otherwise normalize them to LF),
#   - skeleton units ship as binary .hkx.
# `* -text` disables EOL conversion (byte-preserve) while still allowing text diffs on the YAML;
# `*.hkx binary` also suppresses diff/merge on the binaries.
* -text
*.hkx binary
